-Nothing yet.
+- `smysl trace` takes its unit as optional. With none it walks from every root of every view —
+  the seed `salience` already defaults to — and reports the union, a unit reached from two roots
+  appearing once at its nearest depth. `trace STORE` is now a complete command; a lone argument
